    "Champion limit: heading says 0-2, Choice of Warriors text says a single Champion; max set to 1, human should confirm.",
    "Slaves: heading 0-5, text 'up to five'; Bedouins 0-2. Mystic 0-1.",
    "Item names normalised: 'Dagger (Jambiya)' -> Dagger, 'Sword (Scimitar)' -> Sword, 'Hand Gun' -> Handgun; originals in notes.",
    "Tufenk and Katar are warband-specific items without a d6 conversion needed; their rules are not printed in the pages read.",
    "Hit and Run -2 to hit and other to-hit modifiers were left as printed.",
    "Arabian Elemental Magic spells (PDF page 20) not captured by schema: Riding the Wind (6), Skin of Stone (7), Burning Hand (8; set on fire on a 4+ -> 7+ on D12), Quicksand (6), Storm of Magic (9), Blessing of the Elements (6). Table rolled on D6 (D12 in d12heim).",
